"التغييرات يشكل القبول."

#: .\apps\pages\views\terms.py:34
msgid "Eligibility"
msgstr "الأهلية"

#: .\apps\pages\views\terms.py:37
msgid ""
"WonderNet is designed for students and teachers within the Algerian "
